// Copy this file to Debug.local.xcconfig to sign debug builds with the dev
// certificate, so the Input Monitoring grant survives rebuilds. The copy is
// gitignored, so the repository never names a keychain identity.
//
// The certificate name is the Common Name shown in Keychain Access. Create it
// with Scripts/setup-signing.sh, which also writes this copy for you.
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = AngryKeyboard Dev
